SUMMARY:Charter Review Commission Meeting
LOCATION:Tampa Old City Hall - Sister Cities Room 315 East Kennedy Bouleva
 rd Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:CHARTER REVIEW ADVISORY COMMISSION MEETING Date: Tuesday\, Sep
 tember 8\, 2026 Time: 6:00pm to 9:00pm Location: Old City Hall  Sister Cit
 ies Room 315 East Kennedy Boulevard Tampa\, Florida 33602 Facilitator Robe
 rt Hendrickson will facilitate meetings of the 2025 Charter Review Advisor
 y Commission. The commissions purpose is to review the Tampa Home Rule Cha
 rter of 1975\, as amended\, and propose any amendments or revisions by maj
 ority vote of the Commission\, and present a report with their recommendat
 ions to City Council\, which may by two-thirds vote of City Council be pla
 ced on the ballot for a vote on March 2\, 2027. Meetings are scheduled mon
 thly for the 2 nd and 4 th Tuesday. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/n
 ode/180101
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/180101
END:VEVENT
